    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Verifies that {@link AccountingChronology} models eras consistently across a span of proleptic years. <p>For each year the test checks four related facts: <ul> <li>the proleptic {@code YEAR} field round-trips,</li> <li>years {@code <= 0} fall in the BCE era and positive years in the CE era,</li> <li>the {@code YEAR_OF_ERA} field follows the proleptic-to-era mapping ({@code 1 - year} for BCE, {@code year} for CE), and</li> <li>constructing a date from its (era, year-of-era) pair yields the same date as constructing it from the proleptic year.</li> </ul>"
   },
